message:
{{#is_alert}}
**Agent actions are being permitted without being evaluated.**

`GUARDRAIL_ENABLED` is false, so all six pillars are skipped and every action the agent attempts is allowed. {{value}} action(s) in the last 10 minutes.

The kill switch exists so the demo can show the same action succeeding unguarded and being refused guarded. Outside that, guardrails being off is itself the finding: re-enable it and review what ran while it was off, in `agent_actions`.

- Logs: `service:carto-guardrails @guardrail_decision:bypassed`
{{/is_alert}}
{{#is_recovery}}
Guardrails are enforcing again.
{{/is_recovery}}
